<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπέτομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πτήσομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-επτάμην [ᾰ</span>], but poet. also with
			aor.
		
			Act.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέπτην</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fly to</i> or <i>towards</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθεν προσέπτανθ᾽ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έπτονθ᾽</span> Dawes) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ βομβαύλιοι</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				865
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					593a8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐάν τίς σοι φίλος ὥσπερ μυῖα
					πρόσπτηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.11.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>come upon</i> one <i>suddenly, come over</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδμὰ προσέπτα μ᾽ ἀφεγγής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					115
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος προσέπτα μοι</span>
			music <i>stole over</i> my sense, ib.<i><span class="en">
				555
			</span></i> (lyr.); of evil, misfortune, etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς . . ἀρχὴ τοῦ κακοῦ προσέπτατο</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				282
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				644
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				421
			</span></i>.</div>
